# Health Connect Data Analysis Project Structure

This project analyzes health data from various sources and generates visualizations.

## Core Files
- [run_visualization.py](mdc:run_visualization.py) - Main entry point that generates health data visualizations
- [data_processor.py](mdc:data_processor.py) - Processes raw health data
- [GetHCData.py](mdc:GetHCData.py) - Retrieves health data from sources
- [visualize_health_insights.py](mdc:visualize_health_insights.py) - Additional visualization utilities
- [analyze_health_data.py](mdc:analyze_health_data.py) - Core analysis functions

## Directory Structure
- `Data/` - Contains cleaned and uncleaned health data
  - `someshbgd3/Cleaned/` - Primary cleaned data directory with CSV files
  - `gaurav_surtani/` - Additional user data
- `analysis_reports/` - Output directory for generated visualizations
- `analysis_output/` - Additional analysis outputs
- `neo4j_import_scripts/` - Scripts for database operations

## Data Files
Key data files in `Data/someshbgd3/Cleaned/`:
- `exerciseSession_someshbgd3_Cleaned.csv` - Exercise tracking data
- `sleepSession_someshbgd3_Cleaned.csv` - Sleep tracking data
- `heartRate_someshbgd3_Cleaned.csv` - Heart rate measurements
- `nutrition_someshbgd3_Cleaned.csv` - Nutrition and calorie data
- `weight_someshbgd3_Cleaned.csv` - Weight tracking data

